  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Sensation Control 16 is a control-oriented evolution of the original Sensation multifilament. It uses a nylon fiber core wrapped in liquid crystalline polymer ribbons to increase firmness, durability and directional control while maintaining a comfortable response. Designed for the modern big-hitting game, Sensation Control intentionally reduces some of the free power of standard Sensation, allowing aggressive players to swing harder with improved depth and trajectory control.",

    "zh": "Wilson Sensation Control 16 是普通 Sensation 的控制型进阶版本。它采用尼龙纤维核心，并在外层加入 Liquid Crystalline Polymer 液晶聚合物带材，通过增加线床 Firmness 来提升耐久、方向控制和击球稳定性，同时继续保留多芯线应有的舒适表现。与普通 Sensation 相比，它刻意降低 Free Power、提高 Control，因此更加适合现代大力击球球员，让球员能够更放心地完成完整挥拍并控制击球深度。"
  },

